</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fernandez</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Exposure to environmental tobacco smoke in public places in Barcelona, Spain [letter]</article-title><source>Tob Control</source><year>2002</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>83</fpage><lpage>4</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11891377</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/tc.11.1.83</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Ley 28/2005, de 26 de diciembre, de medidas sanitarias frente al tabaquismo y reguladora de la venta, el suministro, el consumo y la publicidad de los productos del tabaco (ley 28/2005 de 26 de diciembre de 2005</article-title><source>Madrid: Bolet&#x000ed;n Oficial del Estado</source><year>2005</year><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.msc.es/ciudadanos/proteccionSalud/adolescencia/docs/Ley28_2005.pdf"/><comment>[accessed May 24, 2007]</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fernandez</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spain: going smoke free</article-title><source>Tob Control</source><year>2006</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>79</fpage><lpage>80</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16565449</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Garcia</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Schiaffino</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Fernandez</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>The Cornell&#x000e0; Health Interview Survey Follow-up (CHIS.FU) Study: design, methods, and response rate</article-title><source>BMC Public Health</source><year>2003</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>12</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12665430</pub-id><pub-id pub